# Example only — copy keys with `pulumi config set`, do not commit real stack YAML.
# See docs/CONFIG.md
name: metal-mirage-primary
runtime: go
description: Talos primary cluster on Azure VMs (bare-metal simulation)
# Prefer one-shot:
#   ./scripts/init-azure-metal-sim.sh --write-clusters --up
# Manual:
#   pulumi config set primary:talosImageId '<gallery image resource id>'
#   pulumi config set azure-native:location eastus
#   pulumi config set primary:adminCidr "$(curl -fsSL ifconfig.me)/32"
#   pulumi config set primary:controlPlaneCount 1
#   pulumi config set primary:workerCount 1
#   pulumi config set primary:talosVersion v1.9.5   # must match gallery VHD
# vmSize is auto-selected by ./scripts/up.sh primary (quota/SKU probe).
